Extracted and structured ZAP results into a dataset.

Trained an AI model using Scikit-learn to predict vulnerability severity.

Integrated the trained model with OWASP ZAP for automated vulnerability classification and enhanced remediation strategies.

This lab demonstrates how AI-driven techniques can enhance traditional penetration testing and vulnerability management by prioritizing and automating responses to security threats.
